{"id": "x0212", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "If you have a coffee spill on your laptop, first unplug it and turn it off. Care fully remove any excess liquid using a dry cloth or paper towel. Don' t shake the laptop as that can spread the liquid inside. Let it air dry in an upright position for several hours or overnight. Avoid heat like hairdryers since they can damage components. Once dry, try turning it on again. If it still doesn't work, consider taking it to a professional repair service to check for internal damage.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 26, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0220", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, the team is based in Santa Clara because that' s where their stadium is. They' re playing at Levi's Stadium there. So they play in Santa Cla ra because that's where their home field is located.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 9, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "x0228", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, I can help with that. On your learner's motorcycle scheme in Australia, you ’re limited to riding bikes that meet specific size and performance requirements set by each state or territory. For adventure motorbikes, which are usually larger and more powerful than standard learners, the options are pretty limited. Most states allow only small-dis placement models, typically under 1 25 ccs, though some permit up to 2 50 cc s depending on where you live.For example, in New South Wales, you might be able to ride a few adventure -style bikes like the KTM 3 90 Adventure S if it meets the power-to-weight ratio rules. In Victoria, similar restrictions apply, so you might see smaller versions of adventure bikes such as the Yamaha TW 200 or Honda CB 250R, but again, check the exact specs for engine size and power. It ’ s also worth noting that many adventure bikes come in different variants, so even if a model is listed, make sure the version you're considering is approved for learning license s. Al ways double-check the rules in your specific state or territory because they can vary slightly.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 60, "carrier_ended": null}
